        "Version": "ab8f3839444a672c5f640aaa78e442022231ec10c0e86e28125cec9a120cdbd1",
        "Content": "Saffron worker 9 readiness record, revision 1, defines production fast and bulk profiles; neither profile is the default.\nSaffron worker 9 production queue limit: the fast profile allows 400 queued jobs; the bulk profile allows 900 queued jobs. A profile must be specified to select one limit.\nSaffron worker 9 production rollback: for either fast or bulk, restore worker 8 if job failures exceed 4 percent for six consecutive minutes.\n"
      }
